- `TerrainRenderer.ts` — `applyBrush()`, `exportRawHeights()`, `exportHeightmapToBlob()`, `loadHeightmap()`, `getVertexHeightBuffer()`, `getTerrainSegments()`, `terrainWidth`, `terrainDepth`.
- `Editor.ts` — `terrainBrushInterval` (50ms), `shiftHeld`, `onSaveTerrain`.
